                   80, T(r"$MSC = 20 + \frac12 Q$; $100 - \frac12 Q = 20 + \frac12 Q$ gives $Q = 80$.", r"$MSC = 20 + \frac12 Q$；$100 - \frac12 Q = 20 + \frac12 Q$，得 $Q = 80$。"),
